# Copy every value from the old host's Environment page. Keep the same
# SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY, or the saved WhatsApp, email and storage secrets
# can no longer be read; keeping the JWT secrets keeps everyone signed in.

# This VM's public address as a name (setup.sh fills it in): 1-2-3-4.sslip.io
